WEBVTT

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:22.750
Until the graduation festival, the city's motivation was taken away, and the aquapot was broken, and I was swallowed up by the whale's droppings, and in the end...

00:01:04.320 --> 00:01:04.940
The coral as well?

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:10.560
Yeah, my father and brother are...

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:13.470
Not just me, everyone at school too.

00:01:13.630 --> 00:01:17.520
We need to save Manatsu who was kidnapped early and get back our motivation.

00:01:18.620 --> 00:01:22.170
Fururun is waiting here.

00:01:22.390 --> 00:01:24.890
Here, a shell cookie.

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:29.130
Alright, let's go!

00:01:29.270 --> 00:01:29.960
The witch's...

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.700
Let's go to the witch's mansion.

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:35.300
Leave the witch's mansion to me.

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:37.380
I remember it perfectly.

00:02:00.410 --> 00:02:01.170
Cure Papaya!

00:02:04.170 --> 00:02:05.210
Fluttering Wings!

00:02:05.290 --> 00:02:07.180
Cure Flamingo!

00:02:07.240 --> 00:02:11.980
Gloucester!

00:02:12.870 --> 00:02:13.390
Cure Love!

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:01.460
Are you okay?

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:02.330
Does it hurt?

00:04:02.870 --> 00:04:03.270
Yeah.

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:05.880
That's me.

00:04:06.060 --> 00:04:07.760
A long time ago.

00:04:07.900 --> 00:04:08.820
The past me.

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:11.640
And the person I saved.

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:14.480
The person you saved?

00:04:14.840 --> 00:04:21.860
The person you saved...

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:34.520
That's right. I was swallowed up by the wings of a whale...

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:47.900
I'll go to the Grand Ocean and get the queen to fix the aquapod.

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:52.810
The witch's mansion is where I told you earlier.

00:04:53.050 --> 00:04:54.080
Leave it to me!

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:57.570
I'll follow you right away, so please take care of Manatsu.

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:13.880
Alright, let's go!

00:05:33.390 --> 00:05:39.470
It's the same as when I went to the ocean.

00:05:39.670 --> 00:05:41.690
I can breathe even if I don't transform.

00:05:42.350 --> 00:05:52.540
Is there a witch?

00:05:52.720 --> 00:05:59.970
With a witch...

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:01.730
Let's get rid of the power of motivation and get the power back!

00:06:03.850 --> 00:06:09.900
It's okay now.

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:16.520
It'll take some time to heal, but what's wrong?

00:06:16.860 --> 00:06:20.620
Come to think of it, this is the first time I've seen you in person.

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:24.920
A mermaid shouldn't be able to become a Precure.

00:06:25.960 --> 00:06:28.720
Why am I used to it?

00:06:32.330 --> 00:06:36.580
Could it be that the Queen once tried to become a Precure?

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:46.600
Yes, I once tried to become a Precure.

00:06:47.740 --> 00:06:50.260
To save the world from danger.

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:58.600
Is the witch's mansion down here?

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:02.310
If it's like what La Mer said, let's go!

00:07:02.760 --> 00:07:27.930
The world is saved by the legendary Pricure.

00:07:30.120 --> 00:07:32.160
After that, for hundreds of years, the world was peaceful.

00:07:32.520 --> 00:07:36.220
However, there was another new crisis.

00:07:36.880 --> 00:07:40.580
An unarmed man who was trying to free the head of the Gu family appeared.

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:45.200
Where did the unarmed man get it?

00:07:45.740 --> 00:07:48.070
He had a cup full of motivation.

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:55.190
Before I became the queen, I was trying to be a pre-cure to prevent the release of the head of the Gu family.

00:08:01.630 --> 00:08:04.980
But no matter what, that wish will never come true.

00:08:05.100 --> 00:08:06.870
What happened to Gu Xia's coffin?

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:12.980
Even so, I managed to take back only the cup that contained the power of motivation,

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:19.460
and hid it in a certain island's cave, along with the doll's bracelet.

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:25.840
What? The doll that the old lady was talking about, the one who hid the treasure?

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:29.970
The witch...

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:33.130
If you meet him and talk to him directly, I'm sure he'll understand.

00:08:33.750 --> 00:08:35.550
I can't believe you're taking away my motivation.

00:08:36.570 --> 00:08:38.240
If you tell me to stop.

00:08:39.050 --> 00:08:42.720
If you're going to eat it later,

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:44.740
Isn't it better to make it later?

00:08:47.050 --> 00:08:51.470
But, well, that's a little more patience.

00:08:51.770 --> 00:08:54.890
Where is it?

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:59.540
Turn left at the end of the corridor and look at the first corner.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:01.420
Thank you!

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:08.660
Why is the Precure here?

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:12.200
The queen remembers the south island.

00:09:13.140 --> 00:09:15.980
The memories with humans will be erased.

00:09:16.420 --> 00:09:19.440
At that time, I had nothing to do with humans.

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:26.070
But maybe I just think so.

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:29.080
Maybe my memories are also erased.

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:33.130
The only thing that will disappear is the memories of the mermaid.

00:09:33.470 --> 00:09:36.870
The memories of the human who was involved with the mermaid will also be erased.

00:09:37.330 --> 00:09:43.230
One day you will also understand.

00:09:44.870 --> 00:09:49.130
The day when you want to erase those memories yourself.

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:53.140
I don't think so!

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:56.690
I can't forget about Manatsu and the others!

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:05.740
What about the legend of Precure?

00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:14.140
There was a doll that made my heart and soul hurt, so isn't it still passed down as a legend to the Grand Ocean?

00:10:14.660 --> 00:10:17.610
It was a legend passed down to the Grand Ocean.

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:20.740
No one knew the origin.

00:10:21.480 --> 00:10:26.930
Those who knew were erased from their memories and sealed away in the room of memories.

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:29.320
But at that time...

00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:35.410
The legendary Precure appeared in front of me and told me everything.

00:10:36.610 --> 00:10:42.390
Let me tell you the secret of the legendary Precure.

00:10:43.060 --> 00:10:57.170
It seems that he is not here.

00:11:00.320 --> 00:11:03.690
Oh my, you two. Why are you here?

00:11:04.170 --> 00:11:05.540
Where's Manatsu?

00:11:05.860 --> 00:11:07.080
Manatsu?

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:08.440
Oh, that girl.

00:11:08.680 --> 00:11:10.320
Is she also in this mansion?

00:11:10.880 --> 00:11:11.710
Don't be silly!

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:13.460
Oh my, how scary.

00:11:13.700 --> 00:11:15.200
I really don't know her.

00:11:15.540 --> 00:11:16.870
Hmm...

00:11:16.870 --> 00:11:18.160
I guess she's old.

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:21.030
But it can't be helped.

00:11:21.250 --> 00:11:24.560
The witch told me that I shouldn't let the Precure look like a witch.

00:11:26.460 --> 00:11:28.790
See you later!

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:58.070
I was looking for it, but I got lost.

00:11:58.550 --> 00:11:59.560
Ehehe

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:00.260
What?

00:12:01.830 --> 00:12:02.830
Hey, Eldar!

00:12:02.870 --> 00:12:03.070
Huh?

00:12:03.290 --> 00:12:03.810
Have you seen the Precure?

00:12:04.730 --> 00:12:05.170
Huh?

00:12:05.550 --> 00:12:05.750
Huh?

00:12:08.720 --> 00:12:08.960
What?

00:12:10.020 --> 00:12:10.380
What?

00:12:12.300 --> 00:12:12.700
Huh?

00:12:23.100 --> 00:12:23.320
Ugh.

00:12:24.170 --> 00:12:25.430
What's going on?

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:26.070
It's so noisy.

00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:29.150
It looks like the Precure broke into the mansion.

00:12:31.880 --> 00:12:34.820
Weren't you the one who was blown out by everyone at the time of death?

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:37.260
What's wrong?

00:12:38.270 --> 00:12:39.410
No, it's nothing.

00:12:40.130 --> 00:12:43.720
Please make sure you don't get too close to the witch's room.

00:12:44.940 --> 00:12:54.280
I can't move like I want to.

00:12:54.280 --> 00:12:56.090
I'm going to invite him outside.

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:10.660
With that, I can fight as much as I want!

00:13:11.160 --> 00:13:15.590
What is it?

00:13:15.790 --> 00:13:17.700
Do not worry.

00:13:19.240 --> 00:13:20.940
Rather, please take a look.

00:13:21.380 --> 00:13:24.120
Finally, so much motivation has gathered.

00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:28.340
Hello.

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:29.520
Hello.

00:15:30.620 --> 00:15:34.350
It can't be helped. I guess I'll leave the rest to John Gilly.

00:15:35.550 --> 00:15:48.220
I don't know what's going on, but the witch's wish will come true in a little while.

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:49.640
Don't get in my way!

00:15:50.870 --> 00:15:52.010
Motivation power is back!

00:15:53.310 --> 00:15:57.560
It's useless to say anything. I'll get rid of the motivation power later.

00:15:58.830 --> 00:15:59.630
YOLO!

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:30.980
Sorry to keep you waiting, everyone!

00:16:31.260 --> 00:16:33.250
You'll get your motivation back after you're taken out!

00:16:34.280 --> 00:16:34.680
Alright!

00:16:34.880 --> 00:16:43.280
Hurry, omegashi!

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:07.280
The power of the five seas!

00:17:32.780 --> 00:17:34.510
I'll take care of it.

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:35.130
Huh?

00:17:35.910 --> 00:17:45.860
Not yet.

00:17:46.820 --> 00:17:48.680
It'll take a little more time to fix it.

00:17:50.270 --> 00:17:52.050
After all, let's talk to the witch.

00:17:52.270 --> 00:17:55.810
Hey, I'm sure you'll understand if you talk to me.

00:17:56.130 --> 00:17:59.340
Please return everyone's motivation to the witch.

00:18:01.500 --> 00:18:03.780
Mother, no matter what it is, it's reckless.

00:18:04.630 --> 00:18:06.110
No, it may be worth talking about.

00:18:06.930 --> 00:18:07.290
What?

00:18:08.180 --> 00:18:10.110
I heard from the queen.

00:18:10.110 --> 00:18:13.610
The legendary Precure and the story of the witch.

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:16.830
The witch must still have a heart.

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:23.240
I won't let you go.

00:18:39.880 --> 00:18:41.460
Hey, wait up! You can't go there!

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:41.740
Huh?

00:18:41.880 --> 00:18:42.120
Oh!

00:18:42.870 --> 00:18:44.700
Power of motivation!

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:58.200
Who are you?

00:18:58.470 --> 00:18:59.250
Somewhere...

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:02.740
I can't remember.

00:19:02.960 --> 00:19:06.080
There's no need to remember, Miss Witch.

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:07.590
Please take a look.

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:10.760
The power of motivation is finally at its fullest.

00:19:12.780 --> 00:19:15.280
Ah, finally...

00:19:15.820 --> 00:19:20.700
Finally, this is the world of eternal aftershocks.

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:22.780
Eternal aftershocks?

00:19:22.880 --> 00:19:25.010
Why would you do such a thing?

00:19:25.210 --> 00:19:28.430
That's of course...

00:19:32.430 --> 00:19:34.460
Of course, of course.

00:19:41.500 --> 00:19:42.660
What was I trying to do?

00:19:45.440 --> 00:19:45.860
What?

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:50.350
I feel like it was very important.

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:52.510
What?

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:55.040
What?

00:20:00.730 --> 00:20:01.310
Remember the witch of Atomawashi!

00:20:03.580 --> 00:20:08.640
You don't have to think about that, witch.

00:20:09.210 --> 00:20:10.820
Leave the rest to me, Battler.

00:20:11.830 --> 00:20:24.500
Oh, the Shroud of Gu...

00:20:24.500 --> 00:20:27.460
This is the Shroud of Gu...

00:20:31.950 --> 00:20:33.360
Heh, I won't let you get in my way.

00:20:33.660 --> 00:20:39.220
I see. I've never seen that before.

00:20:41.200 --> 00:20:42.860
Now, it's finally time to open the coffin of the Gu family.

00:20:44.780 --> 00:20:48.110
Lady, please take a look over there.

00:20:48.610 --> 00:20:52.650
I will destroy this world and give it to you.

00:20:52.930 --> 00:20:53.210
Huh?

00:20:53.700 --> 00:20:55.220
Destroy the world?

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:57.750
Hey, wait a minute!

00:20:57.890 --> 00:20:59.160
I'm not listening to you!

00:21:00.220 --> 00:21:02.260
Oh? You didn't tell me about it.

00:21:03.470 --> 00:21:11.720
The Hitsugi of this Gu-sha collects the life energy of all living things on Earth by destroying the world.

00:21:12.220 --> 00:21:20.400
And it brings eternal life to those who have released the Hitsugi.

00:21:20.580 --> 00:21:28.560
If I have eternal life, my wish of eternal aftertaste will come true.

00:21:28.680 --> 00:21:28.940
What?

00:21:30.120 --> 00:21:30.380
That's...

00:21:30.380 --> 00:21:32.370
That's absolutely...

00:21:32.910 --> 00:21:40.220
Even if it's a witch's wish, I can't accept it.

00:21:40.610 --> 00:21:43.160
Hey, are you going to rebel?

00:21:43.940 --> 00:21:45.900
Then...

00:21:45.900 --> 00:21:47.360
Like this!

00:21:48.100 --> 00:21:48.520
What?

00:21:51.160 --> 00:21:58.660
What are you doing, Battler?

00:22:00.220 --> 00:22:01.540
You guys just shut up.

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:04.790
Now, let's get this over with.

00:22:04.790 --> 00:22:07.450
Get rid of the intruders!

00:22:07.770 --> 00:22:09.480
Yo, Renato!

00:22:09.820 --> 00:22:25.500
Let's go!

00:23:30.860 --> 00:23:31.060
Thank you.

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:00.860
What should I do to stop her?

00:24:01.200 --> 00:24:02.700
Remind the witch of the afterlife of the past.

00:24:03.760 --> 00:24:05.640
What happened to witches in the past?

00:24:06.340 --> 00:24:11.080
Tropical Rouge Precure! The most important thing for witches!

00:24:11.080 --> 00:24:13.070
Let's all be Tropical!
